 Santa – pure fun and silliness!\",\"uploadDate\":\"2021-12-01T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container page-header-nav-wrap","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-content","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"On-Air Chat with Santa Claus"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>How about a funny, on-air chat with Santa this Christmas? Speak to Santa on <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">santaradio.co.uk</a>.</p>"}}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-arrows","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/virtual-voiceover-studio-online","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Virtual Voiceover Studio","aria-label":"Previous: Virtual Voiceover Studio","children":"‹"}],["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover","className":"page-header-arrow","title":"Patrick Stewart Voiceover","aria-label":"Next: Patrick Stewart Voiceover","children":"›"}]]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>On-Air Christmas Chat with Santa</h2>\r\n<p>Having been the BBC Radio 1 Santa for over 5 years and the <a href=\"/bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBC Radio 2 Santa\">BBC Radio 2 Santa</a> over the past couple (along with appearances on CBBC, ITV, and elsewhere), I've garnered a fair bit of experience in character as jolly old Saint Nick. It was not then a surprise when I ended up becoming the on-air voice of Father Christmas over on <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Santa Radio</a>, the world's best Christmas radio channel. Being the host of Santa Radio is a great deal of fun and it's the perfect place to get into the Christmas spirit! And now YOU can join Santa for an on-air, festive chat!</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Qqu-HDA2KJE","title":"On-Air Chat with Santa Claus","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/original-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg","alt":"on-air-chat-with-santa","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<br><h2>Santa Radio ~ <span class=\"ident\">In the Air</span> ~ <span class=\"ident\">On the Air</span></h2>\r\n<p>Santa is also broadcasting 24/7, 365 days of the year from his workshop on the UK's No.1 Christmas radio station.  This is non-stop Christmas Radio as it SHOULD be. Featuring shows, celebrity guests and a <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Celebrity MUG SHOTS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NEW MUG SHOTS</a> page,<br> you can tune in anytime and Santa will be on air. And now you can join him. Get in touch below to begin arranging your very own chat with the North Pole's main man!</p>\r\n<p>Download the app on iOS, Apple TV, Android, Amazon and join in. Just go by sleigh with an Elf to SantaRadio.co.uk.\r\n<br/>\r\n Follow <a href=\"https://tunein.com/radio/Santa-Radio-s252505/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio on TuneIn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TuneIn</a> for updates.</p>"}}]]}],[],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>So, if you fancy doing something truly unique and delightfully Christmassy this winter, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a>. Guy and Santa will ensure your on-air chat will be suitably merry. You'll be the envy of any kids in your family when they find out that you know Santa Claus. But please remember: Santa insists on good boys and girls only!</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"On-Air Chat with Santa Claus","pageUrl":"on-air-chat-with-santa"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","806",{"href":"/voice-over-videos-animals","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/voice-over-videos-animals1.jpg","alt":"Voice Over Videos: Animals","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"Voice Over Videos - Animals"}]]}],["$","$L3","960",{"href":"/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover.jpg","alt":"psg drone race football commentator voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","children":"PSG Qatar Drone Race Football Commentator"}]]}],["$","$L3","644",{"href":"/xs-poker-voice","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/xs-poker-voice.jpg","alt":"XS Poker Voice","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-title","